  "instructions": [
    "Bring a large pot of water to a boil and cook the noodles according to the package instructions.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together soy sauce, oyster sauce, and sesame oil to make the sauce.",
    "In a large skillet or wok, heat the vegetable oil over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the garlic and ginger to the skillet and stir-fry until fragrant.",
    "Add the beef to the skillet and cook until browned, about 3-4 minutes.",
    "Add the cooked noodles to the skillet and stir-fry for 2 minutes.",
    "Pour the sauce into the skillet and stir-fry for another minute.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Transfer the noodles to a serving platter and garnish with green onions.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy."
